    <item>
      <title>Making of the Promotional Artwork for Enhanced</title>
      <link>https://benfernandezmedia.github.io/blog/making-of-enhanced-promo-art/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://benfernandezmedia.github.io/blog/making-of-enhanced-promo-art/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Take a look behind the scenes of the new promotional artwork for the Enhanced series from Benjamin Fernandez Media! This artwork features a concept or rough draft of what Enhanced really means.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-purple-200 hx:bg-purple-100 hx:text-purple-900 hx:dark:border-purple-200/30 hx:dark:bg-purple-900/30 hx:dark:text-purple-200&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2&#34;&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class=&#34;hx:inline-block hx:align-middle&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;
